Package: dev.airdevs.dsh-app
Name: DeepSeek Harness
Version: 0.2.1-rc.5+ios18
Section: Applications
Priority: optional
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Maintainer: Air-Devs <air2@localhost>
Depends: dev.airdevs.dsh (>= 0.2.1-rc.5+ios14)
Description: The DeepSeek Harness app for iOS, in the official app's form.
 One app icon on the Home Screen. Tapping it starts the on-device Harness
 host (no terminal, no separate plugin), resolves the launch token and shows
 the unchanged DSH Web UI. Workspace, sessions and plugins stay server-side.
 The native app shell (SFSafariViewController), the setuid daemon helper and
 the launchd keep-alive daemon are all part of this package; the 125 MB
 Node/DSH runtime is the existing dev.airdevs.dsh engine dependency (the
 same role Electron's bundled Node plays in the official desktop app).
 Homepage: https://github.com/yitenchen123/dsh-ios
